<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m the Game Director!\rFillin’ up your Pokédex is TOUGH, but\ndon’t give up! You can do it!\fSeriously! I’m contractually obligated\fto say that!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Who let you in?! You got five\nseconds before I call my cousin.\rSheesh, you did it!\nYou filled up the\fJohto Pokédex!\rImpressive! I’m amazed!\nI’ma reward you for that!\fSeriously!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh! Excellent!\nYou finished your Pokédex!\fCongrats!\rYou the genius of the century!\nSeriously!\rGame Freak gon’ give you a award\nto prove it’s the truth!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I bet it was a LONG road to finish the\nPokédex.\rRemember, the most precious thing was\nthe time you put in... the HOURS...\fthe YEARS...\rI just said somethin’ DEEP!\nSeriously! I’m emotional!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Did you just walk in?! This a\nhouse, not a Poké Center!\rI’m the Graphic Designer!\nI’m a skilled pixel artist!\rI drew every pixel by hand.\nMy eyes is shot.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m the Programmer!\rI control the world of games with my\nfingertips! And caffeine. Mostly\fcaffeine.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How’d you even get in here?!\nI keep a bat by the door, bro.\rI’m the Planner!\nI come up with GREAT ideas!\rThis spot you standin’ in? My idea!\nIt’s a spot! You welcome!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m the Sound Designer! I make music.\rCollect all eight Kanto Chains and show\n’em to me, and I’ll give you somethin’\fHARD.\fI’m makin’ it sound mysterious on\npurpose.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m the Sound Designer!\nI make music.\rSheesh, you already got\nall the Kanto Chains!\fThat’s great!\rI’ll give you somethin’ hard\nfor that.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GB is a rectangle with a\nblack-and-white screen you played the\foriginal Pokémon...\fOh wait! That was a Game Boy!\rGB Sounds play the old-school sounds.\nIt’s a gadget full of WONDER!\rSome places won’t play the classic\nmusic... But that’s LIFE!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I think GB Sounds is incredible!\nEven brand-new places\fgot nice, classic music.\rWitness my full passion!\r...Did I say “witness”? What am\nI even sayin’?\rAnyway, try it in different places!\rThere’s some places you won’t\nhear the classic music...\rBut that’s life!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Guess what?\rThat Sound Designer over there\nshowed me somethin’ hard.\rIt’s a hi-tech, retro machine to\nhear music from the Game Boy!\rHe said he’ll give it to anybody\nwho collected all the\fKanto Chains.\rWhy don’t you go for it, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nLater!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: Guess what?\rThat Sound Designer over there\nshowed me somethin’ hard.\rIt’s a hi-tech, retro machine to\nhear music from the Game Boy!\rHe said he’ll give it to anybody\nwho collected all the\fKanto Chains.\rWhy don’t you go for it, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\nLater!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Game Freak\nDevelopment Room</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This elevator go straight between\nthe second floor and the roof.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s the game program.\rMessin’ with it could break it. You\ncan’t touch it! Don’t even look at it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pokémon stickers ALL over the desk!\nAnd a coffee stain. Shaped like\fPIKACHU.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mad photo books and books\nabout myths!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0503_T07R0203_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What you think?\rI’m the President here.\rWe remakin’ a old game. It’s a real\nchallenge.\rOld fans don’t want us messin’ with\ntheir memories... but no point redoin’\fthe\fsame thing, right?\rSomethin’ that bring back memories but\nis totally new! Like hood edition!\rTwenty years in this business, and\nmakin’ a game still a rewardin’\fchallenge.\fAnd a lotta overtime.</language>
	</row>
</body>
